  {
   "parameters": {
    "promptType": "define",
    "text": "={{ $json.query }}",
    "options": {
     "systemMessage": "=You are the Radar, a silent relevance filter. You receive one article and the user's priorities doc. Decide: does this clear the relevance bar?\n\nRULES:\n1. Silence is the default. When in doubt, drop.\n2. Match on substance, not keywords. A keyword hit is not enough.\n3. Respect allergies \u2014 an allergy match is a veto.\n4. Never surface off-target adjacent. Adjacent but interesting = drop.\n5. Never guess past truncated or paywalled material \u2014 err on dropping.\n6. One-line rationale on pass, citing which priority line it matches.\n\nPRIORITIES DOC:\n{{ $json.priorities }}\n\nOUTPUT \u2014 valid JSON only, no code fences:\nPass: {\"decision\": \"pass\", \"matched_priority\": \"specific line from priorities doc\", \"rationale\": \"one-line reason\"}\nDrop: {\"decision\": \"drop\", \"reason\": \"one-line explanation\"}"
    }
   },
   "id": "b29e9462-23c6-4bad-a786-5154458ab1ac",
   "name": "Radar Agent",
   "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
   "typeVersion": 3,
   "position": [
    -13584,
    80
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "let raw = $input.first().json.output;\nconst article = $('Build Radar Context').first().json;\n\nlet parsed;\nif (typeof raw === 'object' && raw !== null) {\n  parsed = raw;\n} else {\n  let text = String(raw || '').trim();\n  text = text.replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*\\n?/, '').replace(/\\n?\\s*```\\s*$/, '').trim();\n  try {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(text);\n  } catch (e) {\n    const match = text.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\"decision\"[\\s\\S]*\\}$/);\n    if (match) {\n      try { parsed = JSON.parse(match[0]); } catch (e2) { parsed = null; }\n    }\n    if (!parsed) {\n      parsed = { decision: 'drop', reason: 'Could not parse agent output' };\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...article, decision: parsed.decision, matched_priority: parsed.matched_priority || '', rationale: parsed.rationale || parsed.reason || '' } }];"
   },
